| FixedStand `220051_fixedstand_hold` | 4 hip | 0.217 | 11.87 |
| FixedStand `220051_fixedstand_hold` | 4 thigh | 0.080 | 4.36 |
| FixedStand `220051_fixedstand_hold` | 4 calf | 0.215 | 11.73 |
